1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:01,440
The industrial building we're visiting today

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,440
is allegedly a popular spot for suicide.

3
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:47,120
Honey...you're finally home.

4
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:50,720
I'm glad you're OK. You scared me to death.

5
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:52,800
You should have told me when you
went into hiding.

6
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,840
You fell off the grid all of a sudden.

7
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:59,040
Those loan sharks are after me every day.

8
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:00,640
Thanks, Pops.

9
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:03,760
Must have been tough for you.

10
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:05,520
I'll pay them back.

11
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:10,640
You? You have money?

12
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:11,960
You have money to spare?

13
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,080
Wow! So much money...

14
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:33,840
You scared me to death. What do you want?

15
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:36,400
Are the loan sharks after you?

16
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:38,880
Worse than loan sharks.

17
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:40,320
Sit down...come in.

18
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:44,600
Uncle, you went to the Police

19
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:47,040
and suddenly think Sylvia is dead.

20
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:50,480
Is it because...Sylvia appeared
in your dream?

21
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:52,040
Of course there's more.

22
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:55,280
When I dreamt of her, I felt very uneasy.

23
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:57,200
I texted her

24
00:01:57,280 --> 00:02:00,240
but someone else texted back.

25
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:04,440
Look, Sylvia called me "Dad",

26
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:06,960
but she aways calls me "Pops".

27
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,640
I asked her about things of the past

28
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:10,280
hoping to sound her out.

29
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:13,600
I asked her the name of the dog we had,
when she was little,

30
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,280
she didn't remember.

31
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:17,680
It was so long ago, maybe she forgot.

32
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:20,320
Sylvia had asthma when she was little.

33
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:22,640
We never had a dog.

34
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,320
I confronted her right away

35
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,920
and asked her why she was posing
as my daughter.

36
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:27,840
She flipped out

37
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:30,000
and blocked my calls afterwards.

38
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:32,320
But Uncle, during this time,

39
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:35,200
Sylvia continued to upload new videos
and livestream.

40
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:38,000
It wasn't her.

41
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,280
Look.

42
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:46,960
Wow, thanks for the
"I love Siu Yiu" amethyst.

43
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,440
I love you too.

44
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:52,160
This Sylvia's voice is stiff

45
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,600
and she's not moving.

46
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:56,080
Don't you find that strange at all?

47
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:00,480
Well? Looking for me?

48
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:04,440
Yes...Yau You-fong gave us a new lead.

49
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:06,880
He pointed out something weird about

50
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,720
Siu Zi-yiu's livestreaming
these past two weeks.

51
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:11,360
New one on this side, old one over there.

52
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:15,160
Her facial expression is very stiff.

53
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:17,920
TCD colleagues analyzed the source code.

54
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:20,320
Deepfake was used for this video.

55
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:24,400
Looks like Siu Zi-yiu is most probably dead.

56
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:26,960
Just think, why would someone on the run

57
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:28,320
who ghosted her own father,

58
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:30,560
regularly go live online?

59
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:32,640
Unless someone posed as her

60
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:35,920
and used her to harass Yau You-fong
and Man Nga-kei.

61
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:39,360
One other point can prove
Siu Zi-yiu is dead.

62
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,840
Look at these three dolls.

63
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:44,280
Siu Zi-yiu's father Siu Bong-chak mentioned

64
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,720
his daughter might have disappeared,

65
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:48,440
but the Kuman Thongs she worshipped
were left in the studio.

66
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:52,120
Those who believe in their power put
heavy emphasis on their worship.

67
00:03:52,320 --> 00:03:54,400
Not feeding them regularly may result
in them biting back.

68
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:57,040
You mean even on the run,

69
00:03:57,160 --> 00:03:58,720
she should have brought them with her?

70
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:02,240
Though we haven't located Siu Zi-yiu's body,

71
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:03,920
she has been missing for two weeks.

72
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,840
Plus there's blood found in her car...

73
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:08,480
Let's assume Siu Zi-yiu is dead,

74
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:10,760
her killer posed as her in the livestreaming

75
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:14,200
and harassed Man Nga-kei and Yau You-fong

76
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:17,520
to give the illusion Siu Zi-yiu
is still alive.

77
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:20,080
Someone who knows deepfake techniques

78
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:23,400
and how to hide the IP address in
sending messages,

79
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:26,080
the killer should be an I.T. expert.

80
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:32,480
Probably someone within Man Nga-kei
and Yau You-fong's social circle.

81
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,840
Those harassing messages

82
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:36,080
either call Yau You-fong a scumbag

83
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:38,800
or urge Man Nga-kei to leave her ex-husband.

84
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:41,680
The killer's motive is obviously jealousy.

85
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:45,600
It may be a woman romantically involved
with Yau You-fong.

86
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:49,520
Thinking back.

87
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:53,640
If the child bride is after you both,

88
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:58,000
it could be someone near you.

89
00:04:58,200 --> 00:05:04,720
The prime suspect is someone connected
to me and Angie...

90
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:11,640
This is no time for jokes, you brat!

91
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:13,920
I wanted to know what happened

92
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:16,640
to Master Chow and Miss Koo
after they were married.

93
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:21,040
I also wanted to find more clues
on the child bride.

94
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:23,520
But maybe I was too nervous.

95
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:27,200
I couldn't get back into the hypnotic state.

96
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:30,800
Doing it once is quite impressive already.

97
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,480
Look at me, I couldn't do it at all.

98
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:36,320
If Sylvia is not the child bride,

99
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,160
let's go back to the walled village

100
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:40,560
and see if we could find other leads.

101
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:41,840
OK.

102
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:07,760
Auntie Mui said she has work to do.

103
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:08,520
Angie!

104
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:13,040
Don't touch or something bad would happen.

105
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:18,720
No. I won't let the child bride affect us
for the rest of our lives.

106
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:43,040
This key can't open any lock
in this mansion.

107
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:45,080
What is this key for?

108
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:49,280
The key fell from the wedding gown.

109
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:51,680
Maybe it belonged to the child bride.

110
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:57,400
Kwan Sir?

111
00:06:58,520 --> 00:06:59,280
Bye!

112
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,480
What does Kwan Sir want?

113
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:04,520
He needs me down at the Police station.

114
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:06,320
Did they find Sylvia?

115
00:07:06,400 --> 00:07:08,720
He didn't say. But he sounded anxious.

116
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,640
I'll drop you home first.

117
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:14,080
No need. I'll see what lock
can this key open.

118
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:17,680
Don't worry, I'm out in broad daylight.

119
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,520
I can look after myself.

120
00:07:20,320 --> 00:07:22,080
I'll pick you up later.

121
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:24,320
Bye!
Bye!

122
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:32,720
Miss Man, I found it! Follow me...

123
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:34,560
Over here...

124
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:38,080
I found a box.

125
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:42,960
The key opens this box.

126
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:45,200
It belonged to Master Chow?

127
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:47,520
Yes! You found the key,

128
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:49,360
you have affinity with him.

129
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:50,240
You should open it.

130
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:01,760
Mr. Yau, we asked you to come in

131
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:05,040
because we need you to provide information

132
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:07,120
about anyone romantically involved with you.

133
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:08,800
Don't get the wrong idea.

134
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:10,880
We're not interested in your personal life.

135
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:13,440
But based on the evidence and leads we have,

136
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:16,240
we believe the suspect's motive is jealousy.

137
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:20,520
Tell us about your exes, anyone you held
a torch for or who had a crush on you

138
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:23,920
or any one-night stands. Anything.

139
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:27,480
OK, that may take a while.

140
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,600
How about...among these...

141
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,680
anyone you find particularly suspicious?

142
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,680
Not really.

143
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:37,200
But the suspect sent out so many messages,

144
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:39,600
can't you track the IP address?

145
00:08:39,760 --> 00:08:41,440
We're looking into that.

146
00:08:41,560 --> 00:08:43,520
But the suspect is very clever,

147
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:46,800
every message and video
had multiple encryptions.

148
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:48,000
It'll take some time.

149
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,360
Unless the suspect goes live again.

150
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:51,520
Then it'll be easier to trace her.

151
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:54,480
Unfortunately, Siu Zi-yiu's channel
has been very quiet lately.

152
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:58,720
Does anyone you know have any small gestures

153
00:08:58,800 --> 00:09:00,800
or any little habits?

154
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:04,080
I may remember if I see it.

155
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:09,120
I'll show you the recent footage from
Sylvia's channel.

156
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:10,240
See if that'll help.

157
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:12,880
Those of you born in the Year of the
Dragon, Dog and Rooster...

158
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:19,120
A cockroach!

159
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:23,280
Angie!

160
00:09:26,160 --> 00:09:27,680
Davis? What did the Police want with you?

161
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:31,920
Nothing much. They showed me
Sylvia's old footage,

162
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,560
and asked me if I recognize any
characteristics of the suspect.

163
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,480
But I couldn't.

164
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:39,120
What about you? Anything?

165
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,320
You look terrible.

166
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:42,920
This tin box...

167
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,480
Auntie Mui gave it to me.

168
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:48,000
The key opens this tin box.

169
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:50,720
(New People Daily)

170
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,240
(Ruthless sorcerer killed and scammed money)

171
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:55,760
This is a newspaper from the
early days of the Republic.

172
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:58,720
It's a letter Master Chow sent
to the newspaper.

173
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:02,720
I read it and found out what happened

174
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:07,120
to Master Chow and Miss Koo
after they got married.

175
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:21,360
It's a letter Master Chow sent
to the newspaper.

176
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:24,080
I read it and found out what happened

177
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:27,520
to Master Chow and Miss Koo
after they got married.

178
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:30,160
Here...

179
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:42,240
Ning-yuk, how do you feel?

180
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:47,600
Kai-hin, I'm sorry!

181
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:50,240
I won't make it...

182
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:55,320
No! You'll be fine, Ning-yuk...No...

183
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,320
Master Chow...

184
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,200
Master Sin...

185
00:10:59,280 --> 00:11:02,640
Why is Ning-yuk so seriously ill?

186
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:04,720
Is it because the weddings clashed?

187
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:06,080
Most probably.

188
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:07,600
I just got word,

189
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:09,520
soon after the child bride got married,

190
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:11,600
a fire broke out in her house

191
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:13,760
and her husband died in the fire.

192
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:14,960
What about Ning-yuk?

193
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:17,760
Please help her. Help Ning-yuk...

194
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,240
I can't live without her.

195
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,880
Master, don't worry!

196
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:23,040
I have a way to resolve this.

197
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:24,000
Really?

198
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:34,000
What are you doing here?

199
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:36,920
Master, you look terrible. How is Miss Koo?

200
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:39,600
You should talk. The clash you arranged

201
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:41,120
made Ning-yuk seriously ill.

202
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,160
How dare you show your face around here?

203
00:11:42,280 --> 00:11:44,400
She took you from me.

204
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:46,720
You promised you'd marry me.

205
00:11:46,880 --> 00:11:48,560
Have you forgotten your promise?

206
00:11:48,640 --> 00:11:50,320
I was eight years old.

207
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:51,760
It was a child's talk.

208
00:11:51,880 --> 00:11:53,680
How could you hold me to that?

209
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:56,720
Even if you think I let you down,

210
00:11:56,800 --> 00:12:00,160
I never treated you unfairly over the years.

211
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:01,600
You like pretty clothes,

212
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,440
I tailor made any style for you.

213
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:05,440
I even found you a good husband

214
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:07,440
so you'll have no worries.

215
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:09,360
I even gave you a wedding gown.

216
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:11,680
Why did you come after us? Why?

217
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:13,600
I'm sorry, please forgive me.

218
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:15,600
I only wanted you to come back to me.

219
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,760
Ning-yuk is the only one I love.

220
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:19,200
No one can take her place.

221
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,720
I don't ever want to see you again.

222
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,320
Go away! Go...

223
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:25,760
Master...

224
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:27,280
Master...
Go away!

225
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:34,840
Open the door, Master, I'm sorry...Master...

226
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:44,400
You bloody monk, you scammed people

227
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:46,080
and broke up people's family.

228
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,680
If you dare save that tramp's life,

229
00:12:47,800 --> 00:12:49,680
I will expose you.

230
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:52,400
Ning-yuk, how do you feel?

231
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:54,480
Ning-yuk, don't scare me.

232
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:59,280
Ning-yuk...no, Ning-yuk!

233
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:01,760
Help...

234
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:03,920
Look what you did to Miss Koo!

235
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:06,240
Master Chow won't change his mind.

236
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,840
Give it up.

237
00:13:07,920 --> 00:13:10,000
Spare me your hypocrisy.

238
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:12,640
When Master was gravely ill
when he was little,

239
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:15,520
you told Madam Chow to buy a child bride

240
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:16,920
to bring him good luck.

241
00:13:17,040 --> 00:13:18,960
You wanted to please Master Chow,

242
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:20,720
you deceived him with your fallacies

243
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:23,600
and told the Chow family I'll bring
bad lucky to the family

244
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:25,120
and asked them to marry me off.

245
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:29,360
My pathetic life is entirely your doing.

246
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:31,120
You were greedy enough

247
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:34,960
to suggest I clash the wedding
to hurt Koo Ning-yuk,

248
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:37,280
You have no right to tell me to stop.

249
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:42,960
You killed Ning-yuk...

250
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,920
Let me explain...

251
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:47,520
You're not welcome in this family.

252
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:50,720
You have no place in this village.

253
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:53,360
Get out! Get out!

254
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:05,440
I'm sorry, it was my fault...

255
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:08,800
Ning-yuk, don't worry.

256
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:14,240
You'll always be the only woman I love.

257
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:18,480
What about the child bride?

258
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:20,640
Did the newspaper mention any features
about her?

259
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:23,280
The story is about the monk.

260
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:25,200
His monastic name is Yiu-sin.

261
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:27,840
Master Chow was afraid he might
change his name

262
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:29,600
and continue to swindle other people.

263
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:31,680
That's why he emphasized the point

264
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:33,840
Yiu-sin casts a spell or conducts divination

265
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:35,440
with his left hand.

266
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:38,960
Yiu-sin? Left hand?

267
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:41,920
Well? Did you think of something?

268
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:46,080
Sylvia writes with her right hand.

269
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:47,680
But when she uses the pendulum,

270
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:48,720
or draws a tarot card

271
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:50,240
she uses her left hand.

272
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:52,640
They both have the word "Yiu"
in their names.

273
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:56,000
You mean Sylvia is not the reincarnation
of the child bride?

274
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,120
I'm not surprised.

275
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:59,920
That's why Sylvia conned me into
investing with her.

276
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,280
That made sense.

277
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:04,920
The child bride probably felt the monk
ruined her life

278
00:15:05,040 --> 00:15:07,440
and she didn't get to marry Master Chow
in the end,

279
00:15:07,520 --> 00:15:10,000
that's why she repeatedly harassed us

280
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:11,920
and killed Sylvia as well.

281
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:13,840
Her next step...

282
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:16,480
Angie, don't be afraid.

283
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:18,560
Though we don't know her next move,

284
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:21,120
at least we know she doesn't know any magic.

285
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:23,440
The Police will be monitoring the situation.

286
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:24,720
Don't get any ideas.

287
00:15:26,040 --> 00:15:27,040
Give me your phone.

288
00:15:28,880 --> 00:15:29,760
What for?

289
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:32,920
I installed a locator app.

290
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:35,840
We'll know where each other is.

291
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:38,080
If anything should happen,

292
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:41,600
I can find you at once and protect you.

293
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:54,480
Liz...I ordered hot lemon water for you.

294
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:55,280
Is that OK?

295
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:56,560
What do you want?

296
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:59,040
Angie said you have been sick for a while.

297
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:00,160
Just checking if you have recovered.

298
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:01,840
If you have time to care about other people,

299
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:03,680
why don't you clean up your mess?

300
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,040
You're quite right.

301
00:16:05,160 --> 00:16:07,120
I have enough problems as it is.

302
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,400
Even if I want to protect Angie,

303
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:09,920
I can't be with her 24 hours a day.

304
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:13,280
I hope you can spend more time with her.

305
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:15,360
What do you mean by that?

306
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:19,920
The Police suspects Sylvia has been murdered

307
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:28,480
which means a killer has been
harassing me and Angie.

308
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:30,800
And we have no idea what the killer
will do next.

309
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:36,160
But...Sylvia has been posting and
livestreaming online.

310
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:38,400
Why would the Police think she's dead?

311
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:40,400
Sylvia's Dad reported her missing.

312
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:42,240
The Police started an investigation.

313
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:45,920
Since Sylvia's channel has been
quiet lately,

314
00:16:46,280 --> 00:16:50,040
the Police feel if she was still alive,

315
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:53,800
she should continue to livestream
and have updates.

316
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:56,920
That's why they think she had been killed

317
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:01,320
and the killer is someone among us.

318
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:07,440
I told Angie to stay away from you.

319
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:08,720
OK, I'll keep an eye on her.

320
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:12,160
Liz, why are you biased against me?

321
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:13,920
Are you angry with me?

322
00:17:14,080 --> 00:17:16,400
Or you have something else in mind?

323
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:17,560
You're worried you can't control yourself

324
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:18,880
that's why you're avoiding me.

325
00:17:20,120 --> 00:17:21,440
What are you getting at?

326
00:17:22,360 --> 00:17:26,040
I know what happened that night
had a big impact on you.

327
00:17:26,120 --> 00:17:28,120
Are you angry about that?

328
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,880
Or you simply can't let it go?

329
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:37,360
Yau You-fong, who do you think you are?
A real charmer?

330
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:40,480
I was drunk and used you as a vibrator
the other night.

331
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:42,080
Give it a rest.

332
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:04,720
Excuse me...my name is Davis.

333
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:05,920
Can I borrow your phone.

334
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:08,080
My phone died and I wanted to get a ride.

335
00:18:10,520 --> 00:18:11,280
Sure!

336
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:11,920
Thanks.

337
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:16,960
Your wallpaper...is that
a village in Lille in France?

338
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:17,680
Yes!

339
00:18:17,760 --> 00:18:19,080
I was there.

340
00:18:19,200 --> 00:18:22,720
It's a perfect place to paint and
find inspiration.

341
00:18:23,360 --> 00:18:23,920
Hi!

342
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:27,760
Liz...Angie! Time for a break...

343
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:30,480
How attentive!

344
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:34,160
Look! He bought three...

345
00:18:34,320 --> 00:18:37,840
He looks after you too.

346
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:38,640
That's better.

347
00:18:39,600 --> 00:18:40,960
Let me do it...
Sure!

348
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:44,240
Look! There are three heads...

349
00:18:44,320 --> 00:18:45,520
Really?

350
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:50,960
Tighten this one...OK! Done.

351
00:18:51,040 --> 00:18:52,840
Amazing!

352
00:18:52,920 --> 00:18:55,640
No wonder you're the designer. Good job!

353
00:18:56,600 --> 00:18:58,640
Angie is my roommate.

354
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:00,240
You already show up all the time,

355
00:19:00,360 --> 00:19:02,160
now you even put up a new bed.

356
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:03,520
When are you moving in?

357
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:04,960
Good idea...

358
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:07,200
Are you crazy? Don't say that!

359
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:09,440
Who said he can move in?

360
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:14,640
Why did you have a fight?

361
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:18,400
You should talk things out.

362
00:19:18,520 --> 00:19:21,440
You know your bestie.

363
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:22,960
She doesn't tell you anything.

364
00:19:23,080 --> 00:19:25,120
She holds everything in.

365
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:30,800
Sometimes, I'd rather she can be
more like you

366
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:32,560
and blurt everything out.

367
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:39,120
I wish my boyfriend would think like that.

368
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:45,120
It's just a cockroach.

369
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:47,920
It doesn't understand you raised your hands
to surrender.

370
00:19:48,040 --> 00:19:49,920
I was scared.

371
00:19:54,560 --> 00:19:59,400
It's gone, look!

372
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:06,000
You're quite cute.

373
00:20:06,120 --> 00:20:08,240
Why did your boyfriend dump you?

374
00:20:10,360 --> 00:20:15,120
He thinks I'm too outspoken and aggressive.

375
00:20:15,360 --> 00:20:16,720
Aggressive?

376
00:20:43,080 --> 00:20:43,920
Liz!

377
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:47,200
Angie...

378
00:20:48,840 --> 00:20:51,440
I need to tell you something.

379
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:54,120
Really? I have something to tell you too.

380
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:55,920
You go first.

381
00:20:57,080 --> 00:20:58,960
Davis just proposed!

382
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:02,360
Didn't you have a fight yesterday?

383
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:05,120
Yes, I was quite surprised myself.

384
00:21:05,240 --> 00:21:08,280
He said precisely because we had a fight,

385
00:21:08,360 --> 00:21:12,040
he was more certain about our love.

386
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:13,320
Congrats!

387
00:21:44,480 --> 00:21:46,080
Mom, I'm home.

388
00:21:49,280 --> 00:21:49,920
Mom!

389
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:53,040
Wow, you made such a mess.

390
00:21:53,120 --> 00:21:54,400
Move over. Let me clean that up for you.

391
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:56,640
No...I'll do it myself.

392
00:21:58,800 --> 00:22:00,280
OK, then I'll go shower.

393
00:22:00,360 --> 00:22:01,800
I'm beat after a long day.

394
00:22:01,880 --> 00:22:04,120
Hey...Angie told me

395
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:06,360
the Police summoned you for questioning.

396
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:08,000
Don't tell me they think you're the killer.

397
00:22:08,120 --> 00:22:10,400
Of course not. They wanted me for leads.

398
00:22:10,560 --> 00:22:12,320
Any progress?

399
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:16,240
I suspect Liz was posing as Sylvia.

400
00:22:16,320 --> 00:22:19,120
Liz? Angie's bestie?

401
00:22:19,320 --> 00:22:20,400
I'm not sure.

402
00:22:20,520 --> 00:22:21,880
That's why I didn't tell Angie.

403
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:23,560
I only told the Police.

404
00:22:24,920 --> 00:22:27,280
Liz is with Angie all the time.

405
00:22:27,360 --> 00:22:29,040
Will Angie be in any danger?

406
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:31,360
That's why I'm anxious to find evidence.

407
00:22:31,760 --> 00:22:33,440
I'm working with the Police

408
00:22:33,560 --> 00:22:35,320
and I tried to get Liz to
resume livestreaming.

409
00:22:35,400 --> 00:22:37,120
If she was posing as Sylvia,

410
00:22:37,240 --> 00:22:38,800
the Police can track her down.

411
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,880
What? You're the bait?

412
00:22:41,080 --> 00:22:42,720
Are you sure you're safe?

413
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:45,440
I'm just the backseat adviser.

414
00:22:45,600 --> 00:22:47,360
The Police is doing all the work.

415
00:22:47,600 --> 00:22:48,800
Don't worry about me.

416
00:22:51,960 --> 00:22:56,400
Angie, you said the mattress
is uncomfortable.

417
00:22:56,600 --> 00:22:59,320
This brand is quite good.
You should get one.

418
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:01,200
The one I have is still good.

419
00:23:01,360 --> 00:23:02,400
No need to get a new one.

420
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:05,200
Of course not! You have back pain.

421
00:23:05,320 --> 00:23:06,880
The mattress is the reason.

422
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:08,360
Come...let's look at this one.

423
00:23:11,480 --> 00:23:13,440
It's suitably firm and very comfortable.

424
00:23:13,600 --> 00:23:15,440
Come, sit down...

425
00:23:21,840 --> 00:23:23,760
Sylvia is on live...

426
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:27,800
I have bad news for everyone.

427
00:23:27,920 --> 00:23:31,360
Something bad happened to me lately

428
00:23:31,520 --> 00:23:33,080
that had a big impact on me.

429
00:23:33,240 --> 00:23:36,640
I want to go away for a while.

430
00:23:36,880 --> 00:23:41,520
This channel will be suspended indefinitely.

431
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:44,040
Well? Did we track the location?

432
00:23:44,160 --> 00:23:46,880
We need more time because of multiple VPNs.

433
00:23:47,400 --> 00:23:48,400
Hurry...

434
00:23:48,880 --> 00:23:51,120
Yau You-fong is quite resourceful

435
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:52,400
and made Siu Zi-yiu go live.

436
00:23:52,520 --> 00:23:54,120
Is Siu Zi-yiu's imposter

437
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:56,080
really Man Nga-kei's friend Yip Lai-yan?

438
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:57,440
We managed to smoke her out,

439
00:23:57,600 --> 00:23:58,880
we shouldn't come back empty handed.

440
00:24:00,280 --> 00:24:02,880
Got it! Luk Fat Industrial Building
in Fo Tan.

441
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:05,920
The civet cat is in Luk Fat Industrial
Building in Fo Tan! Go!

442
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:06,880
Copy!

443
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:08,880
Why are you leaving?

444
00:24:09,040 --> 00:24:10,160
I don't want to see you go.

445
00:24:10,280 --> 00:24:12,160
I don't want to go either.

446
00:24:12,280 --> 00:24:15,680
But all good things must come to an end.

447
00:24:15,760 --> 00:24:18,000
It's almost time for me to go off air.

448
00:24:18,080 --> 00:24:20,160
Can you draw a tarot card for us
for the last time?

449
00:24:20,280 --> 00:24:26,640
OK, let's take a look at your fortune
for this month.

450
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:36,840
It's the Wheel of Fortune.

451
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:42,040
In reverse, it means
luck is not on our side.

452
00:24:42,120 --> 00:24:45,360
Things around us are not within our control.

453
00:24:45,520 --> 00:24:48,560
It's time we learn to let go

454
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:51,320
and take things as they come.

455
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:55,520
Police!

456
00:24:55,600 --> 00:24:57,800
We think a suspect is livestreaming.

457
00:24:57,880 --> 00:24:58,840
We need to search the premises.

458
00:24:58,920 --> 00:25:03,800
Just remember, every cloud
has a silver lining,

459
00:25:03,880 --> 00:25:08,080
when things hit rock bottom,
they will only get better.

460
00:25:15,560 --> 00:25:18,480
OK, I must go now. See you around.

461
00:25:20,080 --> 00:25:20,640
(End of livestreaming)

462
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:30,120
Calling control, the civet cat got away.

463
00:25:32,520 --> 00:25:33,840
She got away.

464
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:36,880
Angie...

465
00:25:36,960 --> 00:25:38,760
Why didn't you tell me you're working
with the Police?

466
00:25:38,840 --> 00:25:39,920
You don't trust me?

467
00:25:40,040 --> 00:25:41,880
I'm still guessing.

468
00:25:42,000 --> 00:25:43,800
That's why I didn't tell you.

469
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:47,640
The Police said Sylvia's imposter
is an I.T. expert

470
00:25:47,760 --> 00:25:49,680
who probably knows our whereabouts.

471
00:25:49,800 --> 00:25:51,120
Who else could it be but Liz?

472
00:25:51,280 --> 00:25:52,400
It can't be Liz.

473
00:25:52,480 --> 00:25:55,080
She's my bestie. She would never hurt me.

474
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:56,880
That's how she can fool you...

475
00:25:57,080 --> 00:25:59,920
It's not her. Definitely not!

476
00:26:00,280 --> 00:26:02,000
You don't have to take my word for it.

477
00:26:02,120 --> 00:26:03,520
Listen to the Police...

478
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:05,920
(Kwan Sir of the Crime Unit)

479
00:26:07,360 --> 00:26:08,280
Kwan Sir?

480
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:10,040
We saw the CCTV

481
00:26:10,120 --> 00:26:12,360
and confirmed Yip Lai-yan posed as
Sylvia in the livestreaming.

482
00:26:12,440 --> 00:26:13,440
But she got away.

483
00:26:13,600 --> 00:26:14,840
We're afraid she might strike back.

484
00:26:14,960 --> 00:26:15,600
You must be careful.

485
00:26:15,680 --> 00:26:17,440
OK, we will.

486
00:26:19,680 --> 00:26:21,280
Why Liz?

487
00:26:30,360 --> 00:26:30,960
(New People Daily)

488
00:26:31,080 --> 00:26:32,080
(Ruthless sorcerer killed and scammed money)

489
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:42,160
I never treated you unfairly over the years.

490
00:26:42,280 --> 00:26:43,560
You like pretty clothes,

491
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:45,520
I tailor made any style for you.

492
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:06,120
Hello, Liz? You finally called back.

493
00:27:06,200 --> 00:27:06,960
Where are you?

494
00:27:07,080 --> 00:27:09,520
I need to ask you something.

495
00:27:09,600 --> 00:27:10,840
Let's meet somewhere.

496
00:27:30,080 --> 00:27:31,320
This afternoon at 2 o'clock,

497
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:33,640
on the hillside of Chun Ming Mountain
in Tai Po,

498
00:27:33,760 --> 00:27:35,640
the Police found a headless corpse

499
00:27:35,720 --> 00:27:38,120
hidden inside a suitcase.

500
00:27:38,280 --> 00:27:41,520
It has been confirmed that the deceased
was Siu Zi-yiu,

501
00:27:41,640 --> 00:27:42,960
who has been reported missing.

502
00:27:43,080 --> 00:27:44,840
According to the autopsy report,

503
00:27:45,480 --> 00:27:48,160
though her fingerprints have been removed,

504
00:27:48,320 --> 00:27:50,960
the medical examiner compared
the DNA of the body

505
00:27:51,040 --> 00:27:52,720
with hair found in Siu Zi-yiu's studio

506
00:27:52,840 --> 00:27:53,840
and found a perfect match

507
00:27:53,920 --> 00:27:55,760
and confirmed the deceased was Siu Zi-yiu.

508
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:59,920
The estimated time of death
was two weeks ago.

509
00:28:00,040 --> 00:28:04,160
Yip Lai-yan posed as Siu Zi-yiu
after she was dead.

510
00:28:04,280 --> 00:28:05,520
She's now the prime suspect.

511
00:28:05,640 --> 00:28:08,720
Then she should be the one harassing
Yau You-fong and Man Nga-kei.

512
00:28:08,840 --> 00:28:11,600
The apparatus found inside the suitcase
carrying the body,

513
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:13,680
do they belong to Siu Zi-yiu?

514
00:28:13,840 --> 00:28:16,560
In any case, let's catch Yip Lai-yan
and ask her.

515
00:28:16,680 --> 00:28:19,080
The Police is conducting the investigation
as a crime of passion

516
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:21,200
and put out a warrant of arrest
for Yip Lai-yan.

517
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:23,520
The suspect is a computer programmer

518
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:26,160
and a video game live streamer.

519
00:28:26,280 --> 00:28:28,120
Anyone with any information of the suspect

520
00:28:28,200 --> 00:28:29,920
please contact the Police at once.

521
00:28:30,080 --> 00:28:32,560
The number you have dialed
cannot be connected...

522
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:37,320
(No signal from device)

523
00:28:37,880 --> 00:28:39,560
Did something happen to Angie?

524
00:28:44,400 --> 00:28:47,200
Angie...

525
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:51,600
Why did you do it, Liz?

526
00:28:52,200 --> 00:28:58,480
Yes...I slept with Davis.

527
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:03,840
But I was drunk, I acted on an impulse.

528
00:29:06,840 --> 00:29:12,120
All along, I felt guilty towards you.

529
00:29:13,800 --> 00:29:15,200
But what about him?

530
00:29:15,560 --> 00:29:17,360
He proposed the very next day!

531
00:29:19,240 --> 00:29:21,280
Where are you? Call me back.

532
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:24,480
(No signal from device)

533
00:29:26,880 --> 00:29:29,040
He was a player, he felt guilty...

534
00:29:29,120 --> 00:29:30,000
Let go!

535
00:29:30,080 --> 00:29:32,040
Your marriage was a mistake.

536
00:29:32,120 --> 00:29:32,600
No...

537
00:29:32,720 --> 00:29:34,160
It was good you got a divorce.

538
00:29:34,280 --> 00:29:36,160
But why go back to him?

539
00:29:36,320 --> 00:29:37,200
It's not like that...

540
00:29:37,320 --> 00:29:39,120
Only because you won't let go,

541
00:29:39,240 --> 00:29:42,080
or else none of this would have happened.

542
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:48,600
Come with me...

543
00:29:49,560 --> 00:29:50,960
Let go of me!

544
00:30:04,080 --> 00:30:05,040
(No signal from device)

545
00:30:05,120 --> 00:30:05,920
(Chung Hung Industrial Building)

546
00:30:13,720 --> 00:30:14,640
Angie...

547
00:30:15,600 --> 00:30:16,960
Angie, where are you? Angie?

548
00:30:19,160 --> 00:30:21,200
Angie...

549
00:30:22,600 --> 00:30:25,200
Angie...no...

550
00:30:25,640 --> 00:30:28,760
Angie...don't scare me...

551
00:30:28,840 --> 00:30:31,120
Angie, are you OK? Angie, wake up...

552
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:39,080
Angie?

553
00:30:41,840 --> 00:30:44,160
Davis? I...

554
00:30:44,280 --> 00:30:46,040
Don't move! Take it easy.

555
00:30:46,240 --> 00:30:48,160
It hasn't been easy to stop the bleeding.

556
00:30:49,960 --> 00:30:52,400
Thirsty? Want some water?

557
00:30:53,440 --> 00:30:55,560
No, I'm fine.

558
00:30:55,680 --> 00:30:57,200
Fine?

559
00:31:02,360 --> 00:31:04,160
Mr. Yau, we came to see Miss Man.
Kwan Sir!

560
00:31:06,200 --> 00:31:06,880
Sir!

561
00:31:08,360 --> 00:31:11,600
Miss Man, can we take your statement?

562
00:31:11,920 --> 00:31:12,800
OK.

563
00:31:13,680 --> 00:31:14,960
Who stabbed you?

564
00:31:15,200 --> 00:31:19,200
Liz did.

565
00:31:21,640 --> 00:31:24,760
Sir, where is she?

566
00:31:24,960 --> 00:31:26,360
We're still looking for her.

567
00:31:26,440 --> 00:31:28,400
Why did you contact her?

568
00:31:28,520 --> 00:31:30,720
Didn't you know she's wanted by the Police?

569
00:31:30,800 --> 00:31:32,000
No, I didn't.

570
00:31:32,080 --> 00:31:34,240
I have been calling her.

571
00:31:34,360 --> 00:31:36,160
But she never called back.

572
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:42,160
Until tonight, she suddenly called me.

573
00:31:42,320 --> 00:31:44,640
I wanted to ask her many questions

574
00:31:44,880 --> 00:31:47,200
so I asked her to meet me.

575
00:31:47,320 --> 00:31:48,880
What happened?

576
00:31:49,080 --> 00:31:55,600
When I saw her, I asked her
if she killed Sylvia.

577
00:31:55,800 --> 00:31:57,560
She became very agitated.

578
00:31:57,640 --> 00:32:02,880
So agitated...as if she wanted to
kill me too.

579
00:32:14,360 --> 00:32:17,200
Did Yip Lai-yan admit she's the killer?

580
00:32:20,040 --> 00:32:20,880
Yes.

581
00:32:21,000 --> 00:32:25,760
She posted online certain compromising
materials about Sylvia

582
00:32:26,080 --> 00:32:28,720
and Sylvia found out it was her.

583
00:32:28,920 --> 00:32:31,360
Sylvia confronted her in her flat.

584
00:32:31,680 --> 00:32:35,600
They got into a heated argument

585
00:32:35,800 --> 00:32:39,440
and she killed Sylvia by mistake.

586
00:32:39,560 --> 00:32:42,520
Why did she post those materials
about Siu Zi-yiu?

587
00:32:42,640 --> 00:32:44,400
I didn't know at first.

588
00:32:45,280 --> 00:32:47,040
It never dawned on me either,

589
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:49,600
but she admitted to me

590
00:32:50,720 --> 00:32:57,080
she had a one-night stand with Davis.

591
00:33:02,480 --> 00:33:05,680
After Davis and I were divorced,

592
00:33:05,840 --> 00:33:08,720
she was hoping she could be with Davis.

593
00:33:09,080 --> 00:33:13,200
But Davis soon got into a relationship
with Sylvia,

594
00:33:13,480 --> 00:33:15,200
and she was pissed

595
00:33:15,360 --> 00:33:19,680
because she didn't think Sylvia
was worthy of Davis.

596
00:33:20,600 --> 00:33:25,080
Later when she found out
Sylvia tried to con money from Davis,

597
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:27,920
she wanted to expose Sylvia

598
00:33:28,040 --> 00:33:32,400
so Davis would see Sylvia for who she was
and leave her.

599
00:33:33,320 --> 00:33:37,640
But she killed Sylvia by mistake.

600
00:33:38,400 --> 00:33:41,640
You were besties, why did you harass you?

601
00:33:42,240 --> 00:33:46,560
She knew I'm not over Davis.

602
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:48,480
She wanted to scare me

603
00:33:48,600 --> 00:33:51,520
so I would back off.

604
00:33:51,680 --> 00:33:55,360
But she didn't realize what she did

605
00:33:55,880 --> 00:34:00,400
actually brought Davis and I
closer than before.

606
00:34:00,640 --> 00:34:04,480
She was unresolved and she told me

607
00:34:05,240 --> 00:34:09,120
all the women around Davis...

608
00:34:10,640 --> 00:34:11,920
must die.

609
00:34:14,560 --> 00:34:15,600
(Night of the incident at 3:00 a.m.)

610
00:34:15,680 --> 00:34:16,960
The industrial building we're visiting today

611
00:34:17,080 --> 00:34:18,800
is allegedly a popular spot for suicide.

612
00:34:18,880 --> 00:34:21,280
Allegedly, after four workers died,

613
00:34:21,360 --> 00:34:23,280
no one used this building anymore.

614
00:34:24,040 --> 00:34:25,520
There are exactly four of us!

615
00:34:25,720 --> 00:34:26,880
That's spooky!

616
00:34:27,120 --> 00:34:28,320
Bite your tongue!

617
00:34:28,400 --> 00:34:29,680
Let's move on, OK?

618
00:34:29,760 --> 00:34:30,400
Hurry up...

619
00:34:40,800 --> 00:34:44,400
That completes our adventure today.

620
00:34:44,960 --> 00:34:46,960
Wait, where's Wilson?

621
00:34:49,040 --> 00:34:50,200
Did he go to the bathroom?

622
00:34:50,360 --> 00:34:51,280
Let's go back and find him.

623
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:54,080
Wilson, where have you been?

624
00:34:55,600 --> 00:34:56,400
Look!

625
00:34:56,600 --> 00:34:57,520
What is it?

626
00:35:08,760 --> 00:35:10,000
Wilson found the body first.

627
00:35:10,160 --> 00:35:12,720
Someone reported outside
Chung Hung Industrial Building,

628
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:14,680
Yip Lai-yan's body was found.

629
00:35:18,640 --> 00:35:20,240
Her left leg was broken.

630
00:35:20,800 --> 00:35:22,320
All the evidence and witnesses

631
00:35:22,440 --> 00:35:25,360
indicated Yip Lai-yan murdered Siu Zi-yiu.

632
00:35:25,680 --> 00:35:27,040
We searched her flat

633
00:35:27,160 --> 00:35:29,360
and found evidence of her using deepfake.

634
00:35:30,440 --> 00:35:32,800
Her motive...she was jealous of Siu Zi-yiu

635
00:35:32,920 --> 00:35:34,560
because she was Yau You-fong's girlfriend.

636
00:35:35,080 --> 00:35:37,720
She posed as Siu Zi-yiu in livestreaming

637
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:39,520
to cover up her crime.

638
00:35:39,760 --> 00:35:41,160
Probably also out of jealousy,

639
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:44,640
she continued to harass and threaten
Yau You-fong and Man Nga-kei.

640
00:35:44,760 --> 00:35:47,640
Luckily, Yau You-fong recognized
Yip Lai-yan's small gesture

641
00:35:47,720 --> 00:35:50,560
and worked with us to lure
Yip Lai-yan out.

642
00:35:50,640 --> 00:35:53,360
She gave herself away and finally
killed herself to escape punishment.

643
00:35:53,440 --> 00:35:54,880
Good job! Keep up the good work.

644
00:35:54,960 --> 00:35:56,320
Send me the report later.

645
00:35:56,440 --> 00:35:57,240
Got it...

646
00:36:01,120 --> 00:36:01,720
Here...

647
00:36:01,840 --> 00:36:02,560
Thanks, Brother Bo.

648
00:36:02,720 --> 00:36:05,760
You bought this vajra to cast away
evil spirits?

649
00:36:05,920 --> 00:36:07,520
To cast away evil spirits?

650
00:36:07,600 --> 00:36:10,560
Of course! What's bothering you?

651
00:36:10,680 --> 00:36:14,120
Never mind. The file is closed already.

652
00:36:14,320 --> 00:36:17,200
You can always re-open it.

653
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:18,960
Even though you're in charge of the case,

654
00:36:19,080 --> 00:36:21,840
it doesn't mean you must figure it out.

655
00:36:21,920 --> 00:36:25,200
Just tell us about it. We're a team, OK?

656
00:36:25,280 --> 00:36:26,560
That's right. Tell us...
We'll help you out...

657
00:36:26,640 --> 00:36:27,760
We'll figure it out for you.

658
00:36:27,840 --> 00:36:31,040
Let's drink to that, we all worked so hard.

659
00:36:31,440 --> 00:36:32,080
Hey, Brother Bo!

660
00:36:32,200 --> 00:36:33,720
How come you have a drumstick and we don't?

661
00:36:33,880 --> 00:36:37,520
Looks like Brother Bo is the biggest
beneficiary of today's afternoon tea.

662
00:36:37,640 --> 00:36:38,480
That's right.

663
00:36:38,560 --> 00:36:41,040
Go grab something to eat before
the food is gone.

664
00:36:41,480 --> 00:36:42,800
You should eat something.

665
00:36:42,920 --> 00:36:44,560
If you're hungry, you can't think.

666
00:36:49,000 --> 00:36:51,920
I think there's more than one killer.

667
00:36:52,040 --> 00:36:54,640
Just think. Even after everything
Yip Lai-yan did,

668
00:36:54,720 --> 00:36:56,400
Yau You-fong is not hers to claim.

669
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:59,640
Who stands to benefit the most?

670
00:37:07,200 --> 00:37:11,760
Angie...I wish to apologize to you properly.

671
00:37:13,200 --> 00:37:15,720
What happened between Liz and I
was because I was drunk.

672
00:37:15,840 --> 00:37:17,280
There's nothing between us.

673
00:37:21,400 --> 00:37:25,280
After what happened, I felt so guilty

674
00:37:25,720 --> 00:37:27,760
because I knew I let you down.

675
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:30,560
Right then and there I knew
how much you mean to me.

676
00:37:30,800 --> 00:37:32,000
I decided to devote myself to you.

677
00:37:32,080 --> 00:37:33,920
That's why I proposed on the next day.

678
00:37:34,480 --> 00:37:36,160
She's dead.

679
00:37:36,960 --> 00:37:40,480
I don't intend to dwell on the past.

680
00:37:44,920 --> 00:37:46,720
You'll forgive me?

681
00:37:47,120 --> 00:37:49,640
Can we go back to our life before?

682
00:37:50,040 --> 00:37:54,000
This...this is not the right time to
think about that.

683
00:37:54,520 --> 00:37:56,240
I'm not angry with you.

684
00:37:56,360 --> 00:38:05,040
It's just that...I just lost my best friend,

685
00:38:06,320 --> 00:38:08,320
I don't know what to do.

686
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:09,680
I'm sorry.

687
00:38:12,000 --> 00:38:13,760
My mind is made up.

688
00:38:15,320 --> 00:38:17,280
I lost you once,

689
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:20,320
I won't lose you again.

690
00:38:23,640 --> 00:38:25,120
Please marry me again.

691
00:38:25,840 --> 00:38:29,040
I'll use the rest of my life
to look after you.

692
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:31,200
Didn't you say you want to go away?

693
00:38:32,040 --> 00:38:33,600
You like Japan.

694
00:38:34,400 --> 00:38:37,280
Let's go there and start over, OK?

695
00:38:39,320 --> 00:38:44,880
Davis, I'm still very much in love with you.

696
00:38:45,280 --> 00:38:47,720
But we have been through so much,

697
00:38:47,840 --> 00:38:52,000
it's time we think things through properly.

698
00:38:55,680 --> 00:38:56,720
I understand.

699
00:38:56,840 --> 00:38:59,640
Your bestie was the killer

700
00:38:59,720 --> 00:39:01,840
and she even tried to kill you.

701
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:03,720
That was such a major blow to you.

702
00:39:04,680 --> 00:39:06,480
You suppose she was the child bride?

703
00:39:06,560 --> 00:39:10,960
I thought about that when we met.

704
00:39:14,360 --> 00:39:17,040
Auntie Mui gave me this sketchbook,

705
00:39:17,160 --> 00:39:19,280
which I think belonged to Master Chow.

706
00:39:19,360 --> 00:39:22,760
The drawings should be of the child bride.

707
00:39:24,880 --> 00:39:27,160
She wore so many different clothes.

708
00:39:27,240 --> 00:39:28,880
I did my research.

709
00:39:29,040 --> 00:39:32,320
She came from an opera troupe.

710
00:39:32,400 --> 00:39:34,800
After she was sold to the Chow family,

711
00:39:34,880 --> 00:39:38,480
she occasionally performed in
different outfits.

712
00:39:38,640 --> 00:39:40,880
That's very similar to cosplay.

713
00:39:44,280 --> 00:39:46,120
I made sweet soup with eggs
and bean curd sheet.

714
00:39:46,200 --> 00:39:47,040
Go get it from the kitchen.

715
00:39:47,480 --> 00:39:48,240
OK.

716
00:39:54,880 --> 00:39:56,560
How are things with you two?

717
00:39:56,680 --> 00:39:57,760
Are you back together?

718
00:39:57,880 --> 00:40:00,680
I think Davis loves me

719
00:40:00,800 --> 00:40:04,000
and he has become more down to earth.

720
00:40:04,480 --> 00:40:06,320
I might as well tell you.

721
00:40:06,440 --> 00:40:09,520
I love him as much as I did before.

722
00:40:09,640 --> 00:40:12,760
But after we've been through so much,

723
00:40:12,920 --> 00:40:15,440
I can't decide what to do.

724
00:40:15,520 --> 00:40:18,640
I'd love to have you as a daughter-in-law.

725
00:40:18,760 --> 00:40:21,040
But I know my son too well.

726
00:40:21,160 --> 00:40:24,320
He's not someone who can settle down.

727
00:40:24,440 --> 00:40:26,560
I know. That's why I think...

728
00:40:26,640 --> 00:40:28,560
You must think carefully.

729
00:40:28,680 --> 00:40:31,360
I don't want to see you get hurt again, OK?

730
00:40:32,600 --> 00:40:33,720
I know.

731
00:40:50,320 --> 00:40:53,720
Hello? Is this the recycling company?

732
00:40:54,200 --> 00:40:56,560
Yes, I have some furniture...

733
00:40:56,640 --> 00:40:58,160
Can you come and take a look?
